{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 2091,
  "hub_id": 2776,
  "guid": "com.hazelify.entrypointselector",
  "name": "Entry Point Selector",
  "slug": "entry-point-selector",
  "teaser": "A client mod that easily allows you to choose where to spawn in as PMC or Scav, and supports customization via the F12 menu.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/BoSHHKGQhLAhekBSrVvSmNU4V5EAdUWia4FIhJOi.png",
  "downloads": 13854,
  "favourites_count": 14,
  "description": "<p>I’ve been wanting an updated and more optimal, ideal version of the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/582-select-entry-point/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Select Entry Point</strong></a> mod, so I made a new client mod that updates but also expands the options and settings.</p>\n<p><em><strong>Please contact me via my Discord if you encounter errors. ALWAYS BRING YOUR BEPINEX LOGS!</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Features</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><blockquote>\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong>  DO NOT CONFUSE THIS WITH <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1680/entry-point-selector-20\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Entry Point Selector 2.0</a>!<br />\nThis mod works entirely through the F12 BepInEx menu</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This mod supports the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Spawning in to the exact same place you last exfiltrated from (provided it’s the same map)</li>\n<li>Choosing which exfil zone you’d like to spawn nearby.</li>\n<li>Spawning in to the <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2707-home-comforts/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Home Comforts’ portable Safehouse</a></strong> exfil point. If used, the <code>**Spawn into your last exfil</code>** option will be disabled.</li>\n</ul></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Core section</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Spawn into your last exfil</h3>\n<p>If you want to spawn where you last exfiltrated (on the same map)</p>\n<h3>Choose infil spawn</h3>\n<p>If you want to choose which exfil to spawn nearby on the given map</p>\n<h3>Wipe saved exfil spawn data</h3>\n<p>Wipes all existing player spawn data for all maps (<code>use with caution!</code>)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">All available maps</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>&lt;Map&gt; Spawn Zone</h3>\n<p>Which exfil you want to spawn near as a PMC (regular player)</p>\n<h3>&lt;Map&gt; Scav Spawn Zone</h3>\n<p>Which exfil you want to spawn near as a Scav</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Home Comforts</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Mod detection</h3>\n<p>If HC is installed, it will disable <code>Spawn into your last exfil</code> and override it</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Download the mod</li>\n<li>Open the <strong><code>hazelify.EntryPointSelector.zip</code></strong> archive with <strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/download.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">7-Zip</a></strong></li>\n<li>Drag-and-drop the <strong><code>BepInEx</code></strong> folder into your main SPT folder (where EscapeFromTarkov.exe resides)</li>\n<li>Profit</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Available settings</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-7\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Showcase</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-8\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong><code>net.hazelify</code></strong> on Discord. For support, go to the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.com/invite/Xn9msqQZan\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Discord community</a> and ping me!</p></div></div></div>\n",
